"The Abyssal Temple was under the god Unc, who once ran a jellyfish dungeon himself."
"The fled shadow octopus master, called Gloto by Unc, has sworn revenge on Syl."
"Syl usurped the octopus's Dungeon Master Emblem, but her claim is stuck as pending."
"Syl took the dungeon's CUBE, a device for gathering essence to build a new dungeon."
"Leon stripped the dungeon of bricks and its great door before it collapsed."
